WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.620
Welcome to Rubin Select!

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:05.410
What an incredible run we’ve
been since the creation of our own independent

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.669
production company just two years ago.

00:00:07.669 --> 00:00:11.320
Before I do anything else, I want to give
a huge thanks to all of you who have supported

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.360
us from the beginning, as well everyone who
joined along the way.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.340
We’ve truly been on this journey together,
and it’s been an incredible adventure.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:24.160
You’ve enabled us to build a show and company
that I couldn’t be prouder of --- you’ve

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.380
helped us build our home studio, purchase
top of the line equipment, hire more great

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:31.970
team members, take the show on the road, and
so much more.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.170
Thanks to you, we’ve not only survived YouTube
demonetization, but I’ve also been able

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:41.260
to say no to joining other networks, or taking
deals that weren’t the right fit.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:44.860
Keeping our independence has allowed us to
have the real conversations that I believe

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.260
can help heal the divide in this country and
in the world.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:52.920
But these conversations we foster are only
one part of the solution, and now it’s time

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.359
to kick it up a notch.

00:00:54.359 --> 00:00:58.909
It’s time to build real community around
the conversations we’re having here on The

00:00:58.909 --> 00:01:00.109
Rubin Report.

00:01:00.109 --> 00:01:04.199
After emailing, chatting with, and meeting
so many of you, I’m completely convinced

00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:09.130
our next steps in this adventure is to build
a home where you can not only listen to us,

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.750
but where others can listen to you was well.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.500
Social media can be great, but it’s really
not the place for honest, thoughtful dialogue.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.440
So we’re going to build something on Patreon
that can get you more involved directly with

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.190
us, as well as each other, all while getting
away from the outrage machine.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:28.210
Think of it as a sane space instead of safe
space.

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:32.550
Patreon will be our place to connect with
you, and most importantly, for you to connect

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.550
with each other.

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:37.560
Here, you’ll you be able to share comments,
critiques, and opinions with other people

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.790
who are just as engaged in these ideas as
you are.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:45.970
We will build an ideologically diverse community
of free thinkers from around the world, all

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.240
in one place...That’s where Rubin Select
comes in.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:53.480
This will be our home base for all things
Rubin Report, powered by the very people who

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.590
support the show...you.

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:59.990
This is your direct link to me -- myself and
my team will be in the comments and conversations,

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:03.420
ready to interact with you as you interact
with each other.

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:07.120
Plus, if you join, you’ll get some cool
perks such as behind the scenes footage, bonus

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:10.030
clips, livestreams, chats, and much more.

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:15.040
As we grow, our goal stays the same: having
honest, unfiltered long form discussions with

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:20.099
people from every walk of life, some of whom
I agree with and some of whom I disagree with.

00:02:20.099 --> 00:02:23.870
This thing has gone from a little YouTube
channel to something that is actually moving

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:26.200
the dial of the national conversation.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:30.540
As our influence grows, so does our ability
to really affect change, and I want you to

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.000
be as much part of it as I am.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.550
As our community builds, we’ll be able to
expand the team, produce more content, and

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.920
introduce you to more people and ideas which
will give you the tools fight for what you

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:42.989
believe in.

00:02:42.989 --> 00:02:47.860
Level up in the conversation by joining Rubin
Select now and let’s continue this adventure

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:47.909
together.

